Common RequiredAssessment
    documentation "The assessments and associated required score and performance level."
    domain entity Assessment
        documentation "Provide user information to lookup and link to an existing assessment."
        is part of identity
    common AssessmentScore
        documentation "Score required to be met or exceeded."
        is optional collection
        role name Required
    common AssessmentPerformanceLevel
        documentation "Performance level required to be met or exceeded."
        is optional
        role name Required